(text "22.1k: 4.5 A nominal limit, 4-5 A IC range before resistor tolerance.\n1 uF SS: about 0.09 V/ms initial rise; downstream converters must have input UVLO.\nPOE_12V and POE_MUX_DISABLE await PD/class circuitry. Main-bus bulk and transient closure remain open.\nBoth inputs invalid => high impedance. Full-load thermal budget and rail converters remain in progress." (at 17.78 241.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6e581c42-d40f-5a45-ab5f-fbf7912c71fb"))
)
